{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg","id":813432,"title":"Demonic Familiars from DSG","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-21T09:43:12-08:00","id":813432,"title":"Demonic Familiars from DSG","content":"So I was a bit let down by Demonic Familiars! Only because I feel like they were too restrictive on obtaining animal covers.<br /> <br /> I propose the following argument to you...<br /> <br /> ... are mentally disabled, or 'stupid' people, unable to make Soul Pacts?<br /> <br /> I submit, no! You can make a contract even with the most stupid person, as long as they sign it! Otherwise, we have to start deciding what IQ level is capable of making pacts, and that just gets silly...<br /> <br /> Well, this fact coupled with the Animal Communication embed, tells me you should be able to negotiate with animals as well. They may not be very clever! They may not be very well prepared to defend themselves! But if you can sign soul pacts with children, you should be able to sign them with animals as well, provided you can communicate with them and abide by all the restrictions of the agreement.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T11:36:33-08:00","id":813515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Piff</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg#post813432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I propose the following argument to you...<br /> <br /> ... are mentally disabled, or 'stupid' people, unable to make Soul Pacts?<br /> <br /> I submit, no! You can make a contract even with the most stupid person, as long as they sign it! Otherwise, we have to start deciding what IQ level is capable of making pacts, and that just gets silly...</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026Piff, this is horrifically offensive when you bother to recall that <i>having a soul</i> is the operating criterion for signing a soul pact and having it stick.<br /> <br /> Animal Communication isn't a &quot;talk with animals&quot; power, either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T12:08:23-08:00","id":813540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg?p=813515#post813515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">that <i>having a soul</i> is the operating criterion for signing a soul pact and having it stick.</div> </div> </div> </div> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Shove a Soul into an animal</li> <li>Get ensouled animal to make a Soul Pact</li> <li>...?</li> <li>Profit!</li> </ol><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T12:13:53-08:00","id":813545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg?p=813540#post813540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Shove a Soul into an animal</li> <li>Get ensouled animal to make a Soul Pact</li> <li>...?</li> <li>Profit!</li> </ol></div> </div> </div> </div>Sign a Soul Pact with somebody, have a Mage turn them into an animal, /then/ cash in the Pact. Easy!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T13:26:42-08:00","id":813602,"title":"","content":"Hmm, Death Arcana can probably create a soul for these purposes, I believe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T14:09:34-08:00","id":813637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg?p=813515#post813515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026Piff, this is horrifically offensive when you bother to recall that <i>having a soul</i> is the operating criterion for signing a soul pact and having it stick.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon doesn't really define souls in the metaphysical sense you are implying.<br /> <br /> A person within the context of Demon doesn't have a soul because they are Good, Worthy or Divine, they have it because they have aspects that are important to story - firm emotional relationships with people, distinct and powerful character-defining memories, character defining posessions, things like that.<br /> <br /> In fact, in the context that Demon presents, some people have 'more' soul than others... the more interesting you are, the more connections you have, and the more firmly embedded you are in the God-Machine's system, the more real you become. Some people are very valuable to trade demonic pacts with because they have many things they can trade. Others lead bland, boring lives with fewer options. Within the context of Demon, the former person has a 'richer' soul than the latter, offensive though that may be.<br /> <br /> By the context that Demon presents, animals should be able to have souls. They can have interesting and relevant connections a Demon could easily 'trade' for. It's highly likely that an animal would have nowhere near as much system-relevant information as a human being does, but one can envision selling a new owner to a dog via pact for example if one could communicate the basic concepts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg?p=813515#post813515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Animal Communication isn't a &quot;talk with animals&quot; power, either.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, it is!<br /> <br /> 'Animals are obviously capable of communication, but are they capable of language? Linguists and animal behaviorists have struggled with the question (and how to define language) for years, but demons know the truth \u2014 animals can, at the very least, understand language if it\u2019s presented in a pure enough form. Demons, of course, can use that form.'<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T14:22:37-08:00","id":813650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Piff</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/813432-demonic-familiars-from-dsg?p=813637#post813637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demon doesn't really define souls in the metaphysical sense you are implying.</div> </div> </div> </div>The sense I am implying is &quot;is a person rather than an animal.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> In fact, in the context that Demon presents, some people have 'more' soul than others... </div> </div> </div>Not how a soul pact works. The amount of patch jobs you can get out of a person has no influence on how much Cover displacing their soul gets you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> By the context that Demon presents, animals should be able to have souls. </div> </div> </div>Looking at what supernatural beings can and cannot pact away puts the lie to this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Actually, it is! </div> </div> </div>Look at what the power actually does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}